  "reachabilityNote": "pre-fold (fold suppressed) at-or-inside vertices: 1199 of 24513 sampled (4.9%), across the gown's own y-range 0.568..1.542 m. The fold-on shipped asset measures 487 inside (+X parity) — #691's 463-upper/24-lower baseline reproduced exactly. Same-topology fold-on control (same bake path, only the fold differs; the exported prim re-splits by normal so the count differs by 3 vertices): 628 inside of 24516 sampled. The clamp bounds the trough by rr*(s-1), the lift the fold code itself applies — but the shell already sits at or inside the skin before the fold displacement runs, so no bound on d can reach those vertices; the fix is upstream of the fold (the shell fit), not fold arithmetic."
